      "title": "Deep Dive: Copart ($CPRT)",
      "fund": "Substack / Markman Capital Insight",
      "date": "May 21, 2026",
      "summary": "This deep dive details Copart's transformation from live local auctions to a dominant global online vehicle salvage marketplace. The author highlights Copart's dual moat of owning hard real estate (over 20,000 acres zoned for salvage yards) and deep integrations with auto insurance ecosystems, which drive high fee margins and wide buyer liquidity. Despite short-term U.S. volume share friction, the core thesis points to long-term compounding fueled by rising total-loss frequency, $1.26 billion in FCF generation, and over $4 billion in net cash on the balance sheet.",
